+
+## Hugging Face setup
+
+Bootstrap the provider GitHub repository independently, enroll its registry and
+publish an installable signed version before adding the HF requirement. The
+0.1.0 pin is a target until that release exists; verify the actual version with
+normal tofu init and review its lockfile before applying. Development overrides
+are local validation only and must not enter this production configuration.
+
+Set huggingface_namespace deliberately; visibility defaults to private. Supply
+HF_TOKEN in the apply environment. Retain plus prevent_destroy protects the
+model. No organization-wide Actions permissions or model files are managed.
+Publishing uses HF_OIDC_RESOURCE and job-scoped id-token: write, never a stored
+bootstrap token. Private404 ambiguity preserves state/error. Publisher API is
+undocumented; lost creates require explicit import, not blind replay.
